      "amount": "1/4 tsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh oregano, chopped",
      "amount": "1 tsp"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C.",
    "Place shredded cheese in a mixing bowl.",
    "Add ketchup, olive oil, garlic powder, smoked paprika, salt, pepper, and oregano to the cheese.",
    "Knead the mixture with a spoon until well combined and slightly crumbly.",
    "Spread the mixture onto a parchment-lined baking sheet in a thin layer.",
    "Bake for 8 minutes or until edges are golden and the crumble is firm.",
    "Remove from oven and let cool for 2 minutes.",
    "Use the crumble as a topping on tacos, salads, or roasted veggies."
